# 1. PRODUCT

Build an AI-powered WhatsApp assistant for Nigerian small businesses.

The user should feel like they are simply chatting with a trusted business assistant.

The system handles the complexity internally.

Users should NOT need to learn inventory/accounting software.

Example:

> "I bought 3 bags of rice for 300k."

The system should understand the message, validate it, record the purchase, update inventory, and respond naturally.

Another example:

> "Today I sold 2 bags of rice for 150k."

The system records the sale and updates inventory.

